@@ -0,0 +1,39 @@
+# General Two-Point Order Chart
+
+Date: 2026-09-03
+
+## Scope
+
+Generalise the independent two-point order-chart generator from the K = 16
+instrument to arbitrary descended data `(n', m', M2', V2', k)` with symbolic
+top-face partition strata. Validate against the banked kills and run the open
+large row `(25,15; 21; 2; k = 2)`.
+
+## Input Manifest
+
+Pending mechanical receipt/hash summary.
+
