The corrected open-row matrix is all unit ideals over the three finite fields and over Q. I’m rerunning the delta1-zero row from its corrected native script now, primarily to document the sanity-gate failure rather than promote it as a kill.
exec
/bin/bash -lc 'set +e
for suffix in mod_32003 mod_32009 mod_32027 Q; do
  script="box/orderchart-20260903/systems/21_14_15_6_k4_part_1_${suffix}_std.sing"
  stem=$(basename "$script" .sing)
  out="box/orderchart-20260903/logs/${stem}.out"
