+Each level is monically divided by `h` in `y`; no coefficient leader is
+inverted.  The level-0 normal form is compared with `c*x^k`, and the emitted
+ideal is the coefficient ideal plus the Rabinowitsch equation
+`T*(c*Omega)-1`.
