+
+## Open Row Runs
+
+For `(25,15;21;2;k=2)` the closed-form data are
+
+```text
+K=5, u'=3, e=5, q=3, delta2'=-1, delta1'=7/5, B=-1/5.
+```
+
+The old generic charts had 135, 136, and 137 unknowns with 517 rows.  The
